# Sons of Sudo badge permissions. One login per badge: claudio, danny, walter.
# (%u = the login name.) "pattern" lines apply to every user.

# Slaps (and later other messages) go to  sos/<to>/inbox/<from>.
# You may write into anyone's inbox, but only under your OWN name - the broker enforces
# who the sender is, so nobody can slap in someone else's name.
pattern write sos/+/inbox/%u
# ...and you can only read your own inbox.
pattern read  sos/%u/inbox/+

# Online / offline: you set your own, you can see everyone's.
pattern write sos/presence/%u
pattern read  sos/presence/+

# Group messages (hot potato, summon, ...) for later versions.
pattern readwrite sos/all/#

# A PC login for tools/sos_cli.py: can watch everything (it sends like any other user).
user console
topic read sos/#
